WEBVTT

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:04.940
As one encounter led to a double romance...

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.750
...three beating hearts...

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:09.150
...played gentle melodies.

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:12.450
I, Kasuga Kyosuke, 15 years old...

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:15.030
...am living the best years of my youth!

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:30.400
That's the accelerator screamin', as the tires are squealin'...

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:36.960
...takin' you along, a girl I hardly knew,
in my speedin' coupe.

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:42.680
You slammed the door,
evadin' the shadows that followed...

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:49.420
...sayin' "Take me anywhere, Just go!"

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:52.330
An encounter is like a highway junction...

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:55.400
I've fallen in love with you - that I realized...

00:00:55.400 --> 00:01:01.440
...by the time the seaport was in sight...

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:04.530
"Take me to Summer Side"

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:13.310
Sayin' that you desire
tenderness over a caress...

00:01:13.310 --> 00:01:16.650
"Night of Summer Side"

00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:25.660
...the way you avoided me, usin' that naive look, wasn't so innocent.

00:01:25.660 --> 00:01:28.960
"Take me to Summer Side"

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:37.740
Sayin' that you desire
a caress over loneliness...

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:41.180
"Night of Summer Side"

00:01:41.180 --> 00:01:51.500
...the way you looked into my eyes as you turned back wasn't so innocent.

00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:05.190
An Experience for Two!
An Island of Forbidden Love.

00:02:40.290 --> 00:02:48.250
The sun and sea... welcomed us all...

00:02:56.740 --> 00:03:03.160
...and they felt two or three times more stunningly dazzling than usual.

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:05.180
It was as if...

00:03:10.550 --> 00:03:18.010
It was as if... the sun and sea were trying to challenge us...

00:03:18.990 --> 00:03:22.950
...trying not to be defeated by us.

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:38.410
I'm stuffed!

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:40.610
Gawd, me too!
I'm stuffed!

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:45.040
If I eat any more, I'll turn into a mermaid!

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:50.500
If a mermaid had a tan like that, the fish would be shocked!

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:54.530
Oh, Madoka, you're so cruel!

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:57.100
Oh, yeah...

00:03:58.570 --> 00:04:00.140
I have an idea!

00:04:00.140 --> 00:04:03.200
What is it, Yuusaku?

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:07.460
It was indeed something that
only Yuusaku could come up with.

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:11.910
Partly meant as an after-meal workout... we ended up racing...

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:17.100
1... 2... 1... 2...

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:20.830
...to an offshore island.

00:04:20.830 --> 00:04:23.970
I'm almost certain that Yuusaku suggested it...

00:04:23.970 --> 00:04:29.860
...so he could show off in front of Hikaru!

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:34.830
Dammit... 1... 2...

00:04:36.570 --> 00:04:39.720
Kasuga... wanna swap for a bit?

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:43.770
No way! There's no way that I'll be
beaten by a freshman twit!

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:48.190
Oh, c'mon! Yuusaku,
what the heck are you doing?!

00:04:48.190 --> 00:04:51.160
Can't you see we're losing!

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:53.220
Yes, ma'am!

00:04:54.590 --> 00:04:58.580
If I hadn't lost the draw,
I'd be with Darling right now! Gosh!

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:14.220
Let me row a bit, Kasuga.

00:05:14.220 --> 00:05:17.590
I'm fine, I'm telling ya...

00:05:17.590 --> 00:05:22.030
Say... don't you think that our boat is...
drifting away?

00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:23.390
What?

00:05:23.390 --> 00:05:25.850
Oh... you're right!

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:35.470
In short... the current was so strong that...

00:05:35.470 --> 00:05:38.730
...we lost sight of Hikaru and Yuusaku.

00:05:45.210 --> 00:05:47.400
Let's just... head to that island for the time being!

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:53.880
Fine... in a situation like this...

00:06:01.690 --> 00:06:03.230
It was a last resort.

00:06:03.230 --> 00:06:05.330
I had to use the Power,
being careful to make sure...

00:06:05.330 --> 00:06:08.360
...Ayukawa wouldn't notice anything, in order to get us out of this.

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:20.720
You did it! You did it, Kasuga!

00:06:20.720 --> 00:06:23.370
You really put on a spurt, that's for sure!

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:44.290
Okay, okay, okay!
Stand closer! C'mon, now!

00:06:45.170 --> 00:06:49.230
Now, folks, as Kasuga Takashi's
#1 assistant...

00:06:49.640 --> 00:06:49.670
...I, Komatsu Seiji, wish to take...

00:06:49.670 --> 00:06:51.400
"#1 assistant?!"
...I, Komatsu Seiji, wish to take...

00:06:51.400 --> 00:06:52.540
...a commemorative portrait!
"#1 assistant?!"

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:52.670
...a commemorative portrait!

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:55.110
Well, I didn't ask for an assistant, but...
...a commemorative portrait!

00:06:55.110 --> 00:06:55.190
...a commemorative portrait!

00:06:55.190 --> 00:06:58.210
Those two have the
"Ears from Hell," after all!

00:07:06.020 --> 00:07:09.080
"l bet that Oniichan will be surprised, when we show up unannounced!"

00:07:10.590 --> 00:07:14.700
"Maybe he's doing something he's not supposed to!" "Hey! Kurumi!"

00:07:20.530 --> 00:07:23.500
"We're going now!"

00:07:24.570 --> 00:07:29.820
"Okay, okay, okay! I shall be with you!"

00:07:29.820 --> 00:07:31.880
"What he said."

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:40.920
But... my goodness...

00:07:40.920 --> 00:07:44.360
Maybe they've got the Power,
but only when it comes to overhearing things!
But... my goodness...

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:44.440
But... my goodness...

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:47.770
Well, then, are you ready?

00:07:47.770 --> 00:07:49.280
There! A pose!

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:50.540
One down!

00:07:50.540 --> 00:07:53.150
Oops!

00:07:53.150 --> 00:07:54.070
Good! Good!

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:56.800
I looove to travel by boat!
Good! Good!

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:25.150
Ayukawa...

00:08:30.840 --> 00:08:34.140
Ayukawa!

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:12.460
At that moment, I could swear that...

00:09:12.460 --> 00:09:15.910
...I had encountered...
a southern island fairy.

00:09:57.190 --> 00:09:59.040
Kasuga!

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:01.690
Hey! Kasuga!

00:10:03.230 --> 00:10:05.070
What're you looking at?!

00:10:05.070 --> 00:10:08.030
Huh? Oh! S... Sorry!
What're you looking at?!

00:10:08.840 --> 00:10:14.520
The fact that... my heart didn't explode... completely baffled me.

00:10:14.520 --> 00:10:16.960
The events of that one brief instant...

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:21.740
...seemed to me to have lasted for an eternity.

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:27.630
"A deserted island?"

00:10:27.630 --> 00:10:30.690
Seems like it.

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:33.620
It doesn't look like anyone is around.

00:10:33.990 --> 00:10:36.480
A deserted island...

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:38.840
A deserted island, eh...

00:10:38.840 --> 00:10:42.810
I wonder if they're all right... Hikaru and...

00:10:42.810 --> 00:10:46.980
Huh? Oh, I'm sure they're fine.

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:49.020
I mean, you-know-who is with her, after all.

00:10:49.020 --> 00:10:50.080
Yuu?

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:52.050
Uh-huh.
Yuu?

00:10:57.450 --> 00:11:00.130
I'm gonna tell him! I'll tell Yuu!

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:05.920
Whoa! Cut me some slack, Ayukawa!

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:12.810
It was a paradise, no less.

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:16.150
I remember seeing a movie long ago...

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:20.160
...about a young couple, stranded on a deserted island just like we were.

00:11:22.210 --> 00:11:23.780
But...

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:26.240
But... the couple in the movie were...

00:11:26.550 --> 00:11:28.120
There!

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:29.480
Why, you!
There!

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:29.560
There!

00:11:29.560 --> 00:11:34.070
I'm wondering... just how closely we'll follow the script of the movie...

00:11:34.070 --> 00:11:38.080
There I was, completely forgetting more important things...

00:12:05.260 --> 00:12:09.040
C'mon! C'mon! C'mon! C'mon! Go for it!

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:12.610
C'mon, Yuusaku, get with it! Just a little more, Yuusaku!

00:12:12.610 --> 00:12:16.650
Go for it, go for it, Yuusaku, my boy! Go for it, go for it, Yuusaku...

00:12:16.650 --> 00:12:21.260
C'mon! Get with it! Get with it! C'mon! Show me your stuff!

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:22.760
Man...

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:26.770
...if I'd known this was gonna happen... I'd have eaten a lot more!

00:12:36.790 --> 00:12:40.070
Hey! No resting! No resting! Don't stop, just go!

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:43.100
As long as you're still alive!

00:12:57.050 --> 00:12:59.790
No! This can't be!

00:12:59.790 --> 00:13:04.200
What?! Wh... Why, this is
the beach we started out from!

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:10.250
Oh, no... that means all we did was go around in a circle.

00:13:22.570 --> 00:13:25.540
No! I'm scared!

00:13:27.880 --> 00:13:31.590
No way! Why, that's Hikaru!

00:13:31.590 --> 00:13:33.160
No way! You're right!

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:35.110
Hikaru!

00:13:36.890 --> 00:13:39.530
Yeah! No way! Yahoo!

00:13:39.530 --> 00:13:42.090
Hikaru! That's not a good idea!

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:56.840
Aha!

00:14:04.710 --> 00:14:11.400
As if to avoid me, as I tried to kiss you...

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:18.970
...you, with your T-shirt on, dove into the shining sea.

00:14:18.970 --> 00:14:25.750
The white flower petals on your soaking skirt...

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:32.590
...spread open upon
the face of the blue water.

00:14:32.590 --> 00:14:32.880
Tell me why, when you winked... to say that you'll be mine.

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:35.880
Oh! Sorry!
Tell me why, when you winked... to say that you'll be mine.

00:14:35.880 --> 00:14:48.970
Tell me why, when you winked... to say that you'll be mine.

00:14:48.970 --> 00:14:53.410
"Oh, Baby, Tell me, Tell me..." You're unpredictable...

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:56.740
"Tell me, Lover, Tell me that you need me."

00:14:56.740 --> 00:15:00.550
"Tell me, Tell me"...my Angel of the Summer...

00:15:00.550 --> 00:15:03.250
"Tell me, Lover, Tell me that you love me."

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:07.750
"Oh, Baby, Tell me, Tell me..." I know that you're in love...

00:15:07.750 --> 00:15:10.810
"Tell me, Lover, Tell me that you need me."

00:15:10.810 --> 00:15:11.110
Wait for me!
"Tell me, Lover, Tell me that you need me."

00:15:11.110 --> 00:15:13.820
"Tell me, Tell me"...but you're a mystery.
Wait for me!

00:15:13.820 --> 00:15:14.890
"Tell me, Tell me"...but you're a mystery.

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:18.940
"Tell me, Lover, Tell me that you love me."

00:16:10.270 --> 00:16:11.910
Should we get going?

00:16:11.910 --> 00:16:14.470
Huh?
Should we get going?

00:16:14.470 --> 00:16:14.550
Should we get going?

00:16:14.550 --> 00:16:16.130
If we stay out late...

00:16:16.130 --> 00:16:19.150
...I'm sure that Hikaru & Company will get very worried.

00:16:21.820 --> 00:16:24.790
Yeah. I think you're right.

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:43.470
Oh, no!

00:16:43.470 --> 00:16:44.870
What's wrong?!
Oh, no!

00:16:44.870 --> 00:16:47.680
The boat's... drifted away!
What's wrong?!

00:16:47.680 --> 00:16:47.810
The boat's... drifted away!

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:50.780
What did you say?!
The boat's... drifted away!

00:16:57.550 --> 00:17:00.630
If their boat isn't back
at the rental shop yet...

00:17:00.630 --> 00:17:03.500
...they must still be out there.

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:06.150
Well...

00:17:06.860 --> 00:17:09.830
No need to worry, Mr. Kasuga, sir!

00:17:11.470 --> 00:17:14.580
As the saying goes,
"He who worries trusts not." Right, Hatta?

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:15.370
Uh-huh.

00:17:15.370 --> 00:17:17.270
By now, those two could be...
Uh-huh.

00:17:17.270 --> 00:17:17.350
Uh-huh.

00:17:17.350 --> 00:17:19.550
...doin' this and that, and... oh, how nice...

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:22.010
Hey, you guys!

00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:28.030
Yuusaku, way to go!

00:17:28.030 --> 00:17:31.050
Still, I wonder if Darling and Madoka are okay?

00:17:32.590 --> 00:17:36.550
No prob! No prob! Worst case, Oniichan can just use his...

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:40.570
Ha ha... I bet they'll be
swimming ashore soon! Right, Papa?

00:17:40.570 --> 00:17:43.070
Er... Oh... Ha ha ha...

00:17:43.070 --> 00:17:43.530
Right?
Er... Oh... Ha ha ha...

00:17:43.530 --> 00:17:46.500
Oh, I'm sure you're right!
Right?

00:17:55.640 --> 00:17:57.590
I knew it... It's not gonna work.

00:17:57.590 --> 00:18:00.360
Since I used up my Power getting to this island...

00:18:00.360 --> 00:18:03.390
...I can't summon up enough energy.

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:12.150
What now...? We can't go home like this.

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:30.410
Ayukawa! What do you think you're doing?!

00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:37.350
I wondered... what I could find
beyond these rocks.

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:40.800
Are you crazy?!
You don't know what you're doing!

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:43.810
But... the boat is gone...

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:46.020
...and it's all my fault!

00:18:46.800 --> 00:18:49.130
That's just not tr...

00:18:50.300 --> 00:18:52.270
Ayukawa!

00:18:53.300 --> 00:18:55.280
Ayukawa!

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:57.130
Kasuga!

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:06.660
C'mon! All I need is just a bit...

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:09.550
Power, I hope there's
a little of you left in me!

00:19:27.040 --> 00:19:28.140
You're so crazy...

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:30.110
Huh?
You're so crazy...

00:19:33.110 --> 00:19:34.680
So dumb!

00:19:34.680 --> 00:19:37.170
Wh... What're you talking about?
So dumb!

00:19:37.170 --> 00:19:37.260
So dumb!

00:19:37.260 --> 00:19:40.190
How could you jump off with me...?

00:19:40.190 --> 00:19:43.220
What if you were killed too?!

00:20:02.570 --> 00:20:03.510
Oh, yeah...

00:20:03.510 --> 00:20:05.440
Huh?
Oh, yeah...

00:20:05.440 --> 00:20:05.520
Oh, yeah...

00:20:05.520 --> 00:20:08.580
This is the last one.

00:20:36.240 --> 00:20:38.690
That was...

00:20:38.690 --> 00:20:42.700
...the so-called... "Contact Kiss."

00:20:51.690 --> 00:20:53.520
Um... Listen... er...

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:55.650
Huh?
Um... Listen... er...

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:55.730
Um... Listen... er...

00:20:55.730 --> 00:20:58.790
Do you remember?

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:01.640
You know...

00:21:01.640 --> 00:21:04.670
...the first night we worked at ABCB...

00:21:06.100 --> 00:21:09.070
...on the way back home...

00:21:11.240 --> 00:21:15.570
"Say... Just for tonight...
can you let me stay over?"

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:29.940
Of course I remember...

00:21:29.940 --> 00:21:34.120
I remember. How could I forget?

00:21:34.700 --> 00:21:37.760
Can we... Can we, um...

00:21:43.540 --> 00:21:46.130
...pretend that you never heard that?

00:21:52.150 --> 00:21:55.430
Wh... Why?

00:21:55.430 --> 00:21:58.490
Well, see...

00:22:00.020 --> 00:22:03.840
...well, that was the first time
I ever asked that kinda question.

00:22:03.840 --> 00:22:06.100
But...

00:22:06.100 --> 00:22:09.610
...but...

00:22:09.610 --> 00:22:15.310
...I know it was a crazy thing to say...

00:22:15.310 --> 00:22:19.120
...and... where we are now
is more important.

00:22:19.120 --> 00:22:21.040
That's the way I feel.

00:22:21.040 --> 00:22:23.670
Ayukawa...
That's the way I feel.

00:22:25.480 --> 00:22:29.180
I couldn't help it, man!
I was being a badass!

00:23:20.700 --> 00:23:25.800
And, that's how... the summer at the beach...
for this 15-year old...

00:23:27.640 --> 00:23:30.290
Darling!

00:23:30.290 --> 00:23:32.990
Oh!

00:23:32.990 --> 00:23:36.020
...ended.

00:23:54.940 --> 00:24:02.550
I dream of casting a spell that captures your heart...

00:24:02.550 --> 00:24:10.130
...and makes you crazy about me.

00:24:10.130 --> 00:24:25.480
Love is deja vu; an unfamiliar memory. I feel our lips pressing together.

00:24:25.480 --> 00:24:38.090
Love me... tenderly...
Golden Summer Mirage...

00:24:38.090 --> 00:24:48.300
Someday... Someday...
Please let my body feel your lips...

00:24:48.300 --> 00:24:55.310
...on that morning I'll be called your lover.

00:24:55.310 --> 00:25:06.710
Someday, someday...
I'll be waiting for that moment.

00:25:12.150 --> 00:25:14.360
I was afraid that this might happen!

00:25:14.360 --> 00:25:19.670
One night, at the summer tennis camp, Hikaru saw Ayukawa and me together.

00:25:19.670 --> 00:25:25.440
The next day, Hikaru vanished deep into the birch forest, as if trying to avoid us.

00:25:25.440 --> 00:25:30.300
Next time: "Hikaru Witnesses! The Camp is Full of Dangers!"
